      "title": "Amendment of Municipal Code Chapter 17-3 by adding Section 17-3-0600 regarding transient-oriented development (TOD) streets",
      "relevance": "title17",
      "kind": "text",
      "sections": [
        "17-3-0308",
        "17-3-0600",
        "17-17-02177.5"
      ],
      "sections_basis": "ordinance",
      "summary": "Adds §17-3-0600, transit-oriented development (TOD) streets: N Western Ave 3600–4859 N and N Ravenswood Ave 4001–4799 N. Eight uses are prohibited on lots abutting a TOD street, and a rezoning of abutting property must be to a B or C1 district with a FAR of at least 3. It also amends §17-3-0308(2) and adds a definition at §17-17-02177.5. Effective on passage.",
      "summary_basis": "ordinance",
      "codified": false,
      "review_status": "unreviewed",
      "product_effect": "pending",
      "product_notes": "",
